  "description": "Feature Flags and Entitlements for Cocoar.Configuration. Provides delegate-based flags with metadata via Capabilities. Base classes for temporary feature flags (with expiration) and permanent entitlements. Reactive, type-safe, and designed for clean separation of technical vs business decisions. Includes a Roslyn source generator that emits descriptor-based registry population at compile time.",
